{"id":"edf9ec90faf33353","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-lk-rule-soundness.md","title":"LK与LJ规则的逐结构可靠性","display":"thm-lk-rule-soundness — LK与LJ规则的逐结构可靠性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-lk-rule-soundness","aliases":["72-thm-lk-rule-soundness"],"display":"thm-lk-rule-soundness — LK与LJ规则的逐结构可靠性","depends_on":["[[72-df-gentzen-system]]","[[72-df-sequent-validity]]","[[72-df-abstract-rule-validity]]","[[72-lem-semantic-substitution]]","[[72-lem-semantic-locality]]","[[72-lem-formula-alpha-invariance]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.3.2–2.3.6 and §3.1.1, print32–33,65/PDF44–45,77; local rule verification","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22","review_2026_10_23":"将新增α规则纳入逐结构可靠性论证"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-lk-rule-soundness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-lk-rule-soundness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-lk-rule-soundness — LK与LJ规则的逐结构可靠性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c60a11e47ac58326\" href=\"?note=c60a11e47ac58326\" title=\"72-df-gentzen-system\">72-df-gentzen-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ba1b086fe1d56f25\" href=\"?note=ba1b086fe1d56f25\" title=\"72-df-sequent-validity\">72-df-sequent-validity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e2d6ae13554de5c2\" href=\"?note=e2d6ae13554de5c2\" title=\"72-df-abstract-rule-validity\">72-df-abstract-rule-validity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b286b5d2520ff936\" href=\"?note=b286b5d2520ff936\" title=\"72-lem-semantic-substitution\">72-lem-semantic-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"102b16872a6480ee\" href=\"?note=102b16872a6480ee\" title=\"72-lem-semantic-locality\">72-lem-semantic-locality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b2d9e5da3806795d\" href=\"?note=b2d9e5da3806795d\" title=\"72-lem-formula-alpha-invariance\">72-lem-formula-alpha-invariance</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.3.2–2.3.6 and §3.1.1, print32–33,65/PDF44–45,77; local rule verification"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"review_2026_10_23","html":"将新增α规则纳入逐结构可靠性论证"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\in\\{\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}_\\Sigma\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C\\in\\{\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}_\\Sigma\\}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c60a11e47ac58326\" href=\"?note=c60a11e47ac58326\" title=\"72-df-gentzen-system\">72-df-gentzen-system</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)\">\\(\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)\">\\(\\mathcal V_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ba1b086fe1d56f25\" href=\"?note=ba1b086fe1d56f25\" title=\"72-df-sequent-validity\">72-df-sequent-validity</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sound}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sound}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e2d6ae13554de5c2\" href=\"?note=e2d6ae13554de5c2\" title=\"72-df-abstract-rule-validity\">72-df-abstract-rule-validity</a> 的实例集合定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sound}_{\\mathcal C}\\bigl(Q\\cap\\mathcal V_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sound}_{\\mathcal C}\\bigl(Q\\cap\\mathcal V_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>恒等公理使同一公式不可能同时在前件为真且后件为假。交换、弱化、收缩分别保持索引语义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\land,\\lor,\\neg,\\to,\\top,\\bot\">\\(\\land,\\lor,\\neg,\\to,\\top,\\bot\\)</span> 规则直接按二值真值表检查；Cut中若结论假，两前提的语义迫使切公式既真又假。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall L,\\exists R\">\\(\\forall L,\\exists R\\)</span> 用语义代入引理。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall R\">\\(\\forall R\\)</span>，固定使侧公式失败的赋值，再把不在侧公式自由变量中的本征变量改为任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in D\">\\(d\\in D\\)</span>；前提对全部赋值为真，故得到结论全称。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists L\">\\(\\exists L\\)</span> 对称使用存在见证。LJ是结论空间限制，加的两条单支 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lor R\">\\(\\lor R\\)</span> 也逐真值直接保真。本结论是经典结构下可靠性，未把它称为LJ的Kripke完备性。</p>\n<p>2026-10-23：AL/AR 的前提、结论中对应公式由α不变性引理在同一结构和赋值下同值，故相继式有效性保持。其余既有规则论证保持；这项核对覆盖实际新加入的规则，而非从旧六类结构规则自动外推。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-gentzen-system","status":"resolved","id":"c60a11e47ac58326","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-gentzen-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-validity","status":"resolved","id":"ba1b086fe1d56f25","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-validity]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-abstract-rule-validity","status":"resolved","id":"e2d6ae13554de5c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-abstract-rule-validity]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-semantic-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"b286b5d2520ff936","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-semantic-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-semantic-locality","status":"resolved","id":"102b16872a6480ee","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-semantic-locality]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-formula-alpha-invariance","status":"resolved","id":"b2d9e5da3806795d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-formula-alpha-invariance]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-gentzen-system","status":"resolved","id":"c60a11e47ac58326","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$ 与 $\\mathcal C\\in\\{\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}_\\Sigma\\}$ 取 [[72-df-gentzen-system]]；$\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-validity","status":"resolved","id":"ba1b086fe1d56f25","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)$；$\\mathcal V_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)$ 取 [[72-df-sequent-validity]]。$\\operatorname{Sound}$ 使用 [[72-df-abstract-rule-validity]] 的实例集合定义。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-abstract-rule-validity","status":"resolved","id":"e2d6ae13554de5c2","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)$；$\\mathcal V_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)$ 取 [[72-df-sequent-validity]]。$\\operatorname{Sound}$ 使用 [[72-df-abstract-rule-validity]] 的实例集合定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\in\\{\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}_\\Sigma\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sound}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sound}_{\\mathcal C}\\bigl(Q\\cap\\mathcal V_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\land,\\lor,\\neg,\\to,\\top,\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall L,\\exists R","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall R","display":false},{"tex":"d\\in D","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists L","display":false},{"tex":"\\lor R","display":false}],"bytes":2496,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-212","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-lk-rule-soundness|thm-lk-rule-soundness — LK与LJ规则的逐结构可靠性]]"},{"id":"a1888eb7039fadfa","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma$、$\\mathcal C$ 取 [[72-thm-lk-rule-soundness]] 的四种纯逻辑演算；$\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}$ 为实际有限带标签证明集合。"}],"outgoing":["c60a11e47ac58326","ba1b086fe1d56f25","e2d6ae13554de5c2","b286b5d2520ff936","102b16872a6480ee","b2d9e5da3806795d"]}